    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CommunityConnect: save recordings, clean them, voicemail to text\n\n- Copies every phone recording from Twilio into Supabase storage.\n- **Recorded announcements** are also cleaned by ElevenLabs (background noise removed). Both copies are kept: calls play the cleaned one, and History shows both.\n- **Voicemails** are typed out by Groq.\n\nIf cleaning fails, the original is used, so nothing is held up.\n\nNo passwords in this workflow. Credentials:\n- **CommunityConnect dispatch secret** on the first step\n- **Twilio account** on Download from Twilio\n- **ElevenLabs**: Header Auth, Name `xi-api-key`, Value = your ElevenLabs API key\n- **Groq (voicemail to text)** on Transcribe voicemail\n- **Supabase** on the Supabase steps",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "name": "Read Me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -480
      ],
      "id": "0282daaf-8a79-47b6-a472-0f8ab0a2e5e4"
    },
